  "details": "This is a spontaneous Idea that I feel has merit. Some of us have that group of friends you always want to hang with, some of us have a stream group you know that makes great moments. Could we utilize the Favourite Groups to set a Specialised Status that set of friends see over your default friends list. People might see this as *another segregating* feature. But I feel like its uses outweigh that. Avoid those awkward requests on stream, feeling down and don't want any random person on your friends list joining, World hopping with a group of people and don't want to max out worlds, ect.",
